        "language": "english",
        "review": "Unfortunately, I cannot recommend this game in it's current state and that's coming from a massive basketball nerd. Unless I am missing something, you cannot free move around the court as the footage suggests, it is currently only a free throw simulator. If you want a better version of this right now, I suggest First Person Hooper.\n\nThat said this game has potential and I prefer the realistic setting, if the Devs follow through with the road map I will gladly change to a recommend. I would also say the shot meter should not have the green window so low and we should have the ability to turn it off. Actual 1v1 or 5v5 basketball against bots would be fun too.",
